# Generated umbrella and collection modules: a header, import lines and a trailer.
# `catcrypt-umbrella` names an opt-in local merge driver that merges the import lines three ways
# as sets and writes them in the form of the umbrella generator. Where the driver is not
# registered (on GitHub, in another clone) git uses its ordinary text merge.
/CatCryptCore.lean merge=catcrypt-umbrella
/CatCryptCore/Examples.lean merge=catcrypt-umbrella
/CatCryptCore/ForMathlib.lean merge=catcrypt-umbrella
/CatCryptCore/TimedCompanions.lean merge=catcrypt-umbrella
